 "description": "The 14 alert rules. Input: `enabled` (rule ids switched on, all others off), optional `thresholds` and `for_s` maps, and `ctx` laid over `defaults.ctx`. Conditions come in catalog order (the order of the 14 rules), then in position order. `evaluated` and `disabled` are sets, compared as sorted lists.",
